# ==============================================================================
# Search Service REST API Test Collection (.http / REST Client)
# ==============================================================================
# All client requests route through the API Gateway on :4000 by default.
# Direct requests to search-service on :4004 can be used for direct verification.
#
# - {{gateway}}        — API Gateway root + health probes (port 4000)
# - {{baseUrl}}        — Gateway API base path (/api/v1)
# - {{search}}         — Proxied search endpoints via Gateway (/api/v1/search)
# - {{searchService}}  — Direct search-service URL (port 4004)

@gateway = http://localhost:4000
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api/v1
@search = {{baseUrl}}/search
@searchService = http://localhost:4004

# Fallback Variables for manual/isolated testing
@fallbackStationCode = HWR
@fallbackFromStation = HWR
@fallbackToStation = SRC
@fallbackFromStationId = 85e5a4b9-d365-4096-8349-3675d914c911
@fallbackToStationId = b4445f32-d61d-45aa-a90c-a1d736e530c0
@fallbackScheduleId = 694f399e-45a1-432b-97c6-d9c5664bd0f8
@fallbackSearchDate = 2026-08-21

# Auto-captured response data from station suggest (if run sequentially)
@suggestedStationCode = {{suggestStations.response.body.data[0].code}}
@suggestedStationId = {{suggestStations.response.body.data[0].stationId}}

# ==============================================================================
# 1. Diagnostics & Health Checks
# ==============================================================================

### Root API Gateway Endpoint
GET {{gateway}}/

### Gateway Health Liveness Probe
GET {{gateway}}/health/live

### Gateway Health Readiness Probe
GET {{gateway}}/health/ready

### Search Service Direct Root Banner
GET {{searchService}}/

### Search Service Direct Liveness Probe
GET {{searchService}}/health/live

### Search Service Direct Readiness Probe
GET {{searchService}}/health/ready


# ==============================================================================
# 2. Station Autocomplete & Suggest API (`/api/v1/search/stations/suggest`)
# ==============================================================================

### Station Suggest - Standard Query (Code / Prefix "DEL")
# @name suggestStations
GET {{search}}/stations/suggest?q=DEL
Accept: application/json

### Station Suggest - With Result Limit (q="MUM", limit=5)
GET {{search}}/stations/suggest?q=MUM&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Station Suggest - Search by Full/Partial City or Station Name (q="New Delhi")
GET {{search}}/stations/suggest?q=New%20Delhi
Accept: application/json

### Station Suggest - FAIL Case: Query too short (q < 2 characters) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/stations/suggest?q=D
Accept: application/json

### Station Suggest - FAIL Case: Limit exceeds maximum allowable limit (limit > 20) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/stations/suggest?q=DEL&limit=50
Accept: application/json

### Station Suggest - FAIL Case: Invalid limit parameter type -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/stations/suggest?q=DEL&limit=abc
Accept: application/json


# ==============================================================================
# 3. Train Search API (`/api/v1/search/trains`)
# ==============================================================================

### Train Search - Standard Search by Station Codes & Date
# @name searchTrains
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{fallbackFromStation}}&toStation={{fallbackToStation}}&date={{fallbackSearchDate}}
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - Search using Auto-Captured Station Code from Suggestion
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{suggestedStationCode}}&toStation={{fallbackToStation}}&date={{fallbackSearchDate}}
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - Search by Station UUIDs
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{fallbackFromStationId}}&toStation={{fallbackToStationId}}&date={{fallbackSearchDate}}
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - Filter by Category (RAJDHANI)
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{fallbackFromStation}}&toStation={{fallbackToStation}}&date={{fallbackSearchDate}}&category=RAJDHANI
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - Filter by Category (VANDE_BHARAT)
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{fallbackFromStation}}&toStation={{fallbackToStation}}&date={{fallbackSearchDate}}&category=VANDE_BHARAT
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - Filter by Category (SHATABDI)
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{fallbackFromStation}}&toStation={{fallbackToStation}}&date={{fallbackSearchDate}}&category=SHATABDI
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - Pagination Parameters (limit=10, offset=0)
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{fallbackFromStation}}&toStation={{fallbackToStation}}&date={{fallbackSearchDate}}&limit=10&offset=0
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - FAIL Case: Missing Required Query Parameters (missing date & toStation) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation=NDLS
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - FAIL Case: Invalid Date Format (DD-MM-YYYY instead of YYYY-MM-DD) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{fallbackFromStation}}&toStation={{fallbackToStation}}&date=21-08-2026
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - FAIL Case: Invalid Train Category -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{fallbackFromStation}}&toStation={{fallbackToStation}}&date={{fallbackSearchDate}}&category=BULLET_TRAIN
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - FAIL Case: Invalid Pagination Offset (negative offset) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{fallbackFromStation}}&toStation={{fallbackToStation}}&date={{fallbackSearchDate}}&offset=-5
Accept: application/json

### Train Search - FAIL Case: Limit exceeds maximum allowed threshold (limit > 50) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/trains?fromStation={{fallbackFromStation}}&toStation={{fallbackToStation}}&date={{fallbackSearchDate}}&limit=100
Accept: application/json


# ==============================================================================
# 4. Seat Map API (`/api/v1/search/schedules/:scheduleId/seat-map`)
# ==============================================================================

### Seat Map - Standard Request via Gateway
# @name getSeatMap
GET {{search}}/schedules/{{fallbackScheduleId}}/seat-map?fromStationId={{fallbackFromStationId}}&toStationId={{fallbackToStationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Direct search-service test (bypasses Gateway 5s timeout)
GET http://localhost:4004/search/schedules/{{fallbackScheduleId}}/seat-map?fromStationId={{fallbackFromStationId}}&toStationId={{fallbackToStationId}}
Accept: application/json


### Seat Map - FAIL Case: Invalid scheduleId format (non-UUID) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/schedules/invalid-schedule-uuid/seat-map?fromStationId={{fallbackFromStationId}}&toStationId={{fallbackToStationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Seat Map - FAIL Case: Invalid fromStationId format (non-UUID) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/schedules/{{fallbackScheduleId}}/seat-map?fromStationId=invalid-uuid&toStationId={{fallbackToStationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Seat Map - FAIL Case: Identical fromStationId and toStationId -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/schedules/{{fallbackScheduleId}}/seat-map?fromStationId={{fallbackFromStationId}}&toStationId={{fallbackFromStationId}}
Accept: application/json

### Seat Map - FAIL Case: Missing required query parameters (missing toStationId) -> 400 Bad Request
GET {{search}}/schedules/{{fallbackScheduleId}}/seat-map?fromStationId={{fallbackFromStationId}}
Accept: application/json

